7. Create the test strategy\
\
Create or update:\
\
- TEST_STRATEGY.md\
- TEST_PLAN.md\
- TESTS/ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA_MAP.md\
- TESTS/MANUAL_TEST_CHECKLIST.md\
- TEST_RESULTS.md\
