The artifact registry must identify which files are authoritative, active, draft, generated, temporary, superseded, deprecated, cancelled, or archived.\
\
9. Set up development guardrails\
\
Create or update:\
\
- HOOKS_AND_GUARDRAILS.md\
- CI_CD_GUIDE.md\
- SECURITY_AND_PRIVACY.md\
- OBSERVABILITY.md\
- RELEASE_READINESS.md\
- CONTRIBUTING.md\
\
